Hi Nick,

Thanks a lot for your great help!

I spotted those mistakes in the data and distance files, but managed to send you the non-update files. Although I didn't realize areas should be labelled with letters. I hope other users can benefit from this input as well.

I didn't spot the problem with the newick file. The tree was cut from a larger phylogeny. But as it loaded correctly into FigTree I assumed that it was ok. Good to know that my quality control pipeline can be optimized.

Thanks for the help!

Vincent

